#
# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the naming tests. OpenCASCADE 8.0.1 leaks a few bytes per call
# in TNaming_Builder::Select (reached from TNaming_Selector::Solve); the OCAF practical test of
# AP-0.6 triggers it. It is a defect of the library, not of the prototype.
leak:TNaming_Builder::Select
